{
  "label": "day91",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day91:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone1.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"With just a few days left until the testing period finally begins, the girls are",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "hard at work and studying diligently.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei! Come look at my sword!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s sharp enough to cut three bodies in one strike!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure it is, Ayane. I can see it from here. It’s very nice.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will use this blade to defend our children.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure you will.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay, so maybe not everyone is studying diligently.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, only Makoto is. But that’s basically how things are in here now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m not too worried, though. I mean, everyone seems confident enough to pass at least most of the subjects.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m not sure how grading for these things goes, but I’m sure you don’t have to pass every subject, right?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh well. They’ll be fine. It would be incredibly disruptive to the plot if they weren’t.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone2.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana suddenly raises her hand and I can hear her ellipses from the back of the room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not like her to command my attention in class...I wonder if something is wrong?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone3.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Sana. Do you need something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...Not particularly...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just...seemed bored...so I thought I’d wave you over and...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You wanted to see if I wanted to talk, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R-right...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m still...not really friends with anyone else and...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone4.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And Ayane has a sword for some reason...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you surprised by this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I should be, but...no...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "s \"Sword aside, don’t you think maybe it might be time to branch out a little and...you know, maybe",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "make some friends?\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone5.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": W-What?! You mean...like...right now?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": With everyone watching?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one is even looking at you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone6.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What else is new?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana...even if people were looking at you, it shouldn’t change anything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "s \"The key to becoming social is just learning how to ignore everybody and adapt to conversation",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "without putting any actual thought into it.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone7.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please...don’t try to sabotage me, Sensei...I have a hard enough time as is...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, how about this? I’ll make the first move for you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone5.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...what? First move? What are you going to do?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Something I should have done a long time ago...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone6.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t like the sound of this...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s okay. Just think about all of our training.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone7.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve...barely even taught me anything...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone8.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Rin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone9.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? Sensei? What’s up?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not much. How are you doing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana suddenly begins to tug on my sleeve.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...S-Sensei...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone10.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...I mean, I’m pretty good I guess. Just looking outside the window and stuff.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "s \"Awesome. But what if I told you that there were more exciting things to do than",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "look out of the window?\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone11.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d...agree? I just don’t know what else to do instead.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Futaba is reading and stuff and she doesn’t like being bothered in the middle of that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The tugging grows stronger.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well how about you talk to Sana, then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone12.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, sure. I’d love to.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s just always so quiet that I didn’t think she really wanted to talk to anybody.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone13.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...I would...love to talk!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? That wasn’t so hard, was it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just talk to Rin the same way you talk to me and everything will be fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone14.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Will you...stay and make sure I do everything right?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. Your mission begins now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have fun!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone15.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Cool! Mission text!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone16.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...umm...ahh...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Sana! What’s up?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...nothing! Wh-What’s...up...with you?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, you know. Just hangin’ around the classroom, doing classroom stuff. Same old, same old.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The two of us haven’t really talked before, have we?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"I stand several steps back and watch as Sana begins her first ever conversation",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "girl who has sat literally right next to her for the entire year.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In order to get a good look, though, I need to stand right next to Ayane.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which of course means I need to continuously swat her hand away from me every three seconds.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone17.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...no...we haven’t...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve always...wanted to, but...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s okay. Take your time.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I get nervous around new people, too. Don’t worry about it.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "r \"Besides, it’s not like I’m going anywhere. We’re still in[school] for another",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "like, three hours or something.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone18.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": R-Right! Th...thanks...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course! So, is there anything you’d like to talk about?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You play games and stuff, right?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "As expected, Rin takes the lead in the conversation and begins to steer Sana back into her comfort zone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think back to the other day when I was hanging out with Sara and Haruka.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I remember thinking then that it was weird these two had never gotten to know each other.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, given Sana’s current skill level when it comes to public speaking, Rin is probably a great option for a first non-Ayane friend.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone19.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Y-Yes! I love games! Do you...um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you play anything, Rin?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Great job, Sana- already calling her by her name.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"It’s a small detail, but a very important one in the world of socialization. Using someone’s",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "name helps assure them that you’re paying attention.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sure Rin doesn’t care about (Or even notice) things like that, but I’m still proud regardless.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Senseiiiii~",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane, stop touching me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Boo...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone20.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "r \"Let’s see...I don’t really have as much time to play stuff as I used to, but I",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "really like online multiplayer stuff mostly.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So like...MMO’s? Or do you like shooters more?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene daynineone21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/daynineone21.webp",
      "alt": "daynineone21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
